  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Digital Skill set through coding for Public schools in Kyrgyzstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will improve English language skills by equipping students in public schools in Kyrgyzstan with essential digital and programming skills, fostering logical thinking, creativity, and preparedness for future careers. The project will primarily benefit grade 7&#x2013;8 students and teachers in selected pilot schools. The intended change is to integrate programming education into public schools, including rural and under-resourced areas, thereby creating a strong foundation for nationwide expansion.</narrative>
  </description>
